WEBVTT

00:10:59.438 --> 00:11:01.309
And when you reach for the horizon,

00:11:01.333 --> 00:11:03.451
as I've proven, you may not get there.

00:11:04.036 --> 00:11:09.463
But what a tremendous build
of character and spirit

00:11:10.392 --> 00:11:12.385
that you lay down;

00:11:12.409 --> 00:11:16.299
what a foundation you lay down
in reaching for those horizons.

00:11:17.889 --> 00:11:19.742
And now, the shore is coming.

00:11:20.432 --> 00:11:22.976
And there's just a little part
of me that's sad.

00:11:23.579 --> 00:11:25.796
The epic journey is going to be over.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.886
So many people come up to me now and say,

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:29.103
"What's next?"

00:11:29.127 --> 00:11:30.549
(Laughter)